#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:1
msgid "Claude Code Setup"
msgstr "Claude Code 接入配置"

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:3
msgid ""
"Point Claude Code at a HybridInference gateway, so it uses that "
"deployment's models and API key instead of Anthropic's."
msgstr "让 Claude Code 连接 HybridInference 网关，改用该部署的模型和 API key，而不是 Anthropic 的。"

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:6
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:8
msgid ""
"Edit `~/.claude/settings.json` (`%USERPROFILE%\\.claude\\settings.json` "
"on Windows):"
msgstr ""
"编辑 `~/.claude/settings.json`（Windows 上是 "
"`%USERPROFILE%\\.claude\\settings.json`）："

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:21
msgid ""
"`/anthropic` is the gateway's Anthropic-compatible surface: Claude Code "
"sends `/anthropic/v1/messages` and `/anthropic/v1/messages/count_tokens`."
" The same endpoints also answer at `/v1/messages`. The `model` setting is"
" optional; it picks the starting model, and `/model` changes it."
msgstr ""
"`/anthropic` 是网关兼容 Anthropic 的接口：Claude Code 会请求 `/anthropic/v1/messages`"
" 和 `/anthropic/v1/messages/count_tokens`。同样的端点也可以通过 `/v1/messages` "
"访问。`model` 设置是可选的，它决定启动时使用的模型，之后可以用 `/model` 切换。"

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:26
msgid ""
"Which variables your Claude Code version reads, its timeouts, and whether"
" `settings.json` alone is enough are Claude Code's behavior, not the "
"gateway's. See Anthropic's [LLM gateway](https://code.claude.com/docs/en"
"/llm-gateway-connect), [model "
"configuration](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/model-config) and "
"[installation](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/installation) "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"你的 Claude Code 版本读取哪些变量、超时多长、只配置 `settings.json` 是否足够，这些都由 Claude Code "
"决定，与网关无关。参见 Anthropic 的 [LLM 网关](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/llm-"
"gateway-connect)、[模型配置](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/model-"
"config)和[安装](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/installation)文档。"

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:32
msgid "Model Families and Aliases"
msgstr "模型家族与别名"

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:34
msgid ""
"Claude Code asks for models by Anthropic's names. The gateway translates "
"the names it knows before looking the model up:"
msgstr "Claude Code 用 Anthropic 的名称请求模型。网关在查找模型之前，会先转换它认识的名称："

