#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:43
msgid ""
"A deployment registers the right-hand id (as a model id or an alias), not"
" the name Claude Code sends; registering `claude-sonnet-4-6` itself gives"
" a 404. Any other id is looked up as sent. A long-context marker such as "
"`claude-sonnet-4-6[1m]` is removed first, so never register the bracketed"
" form. Not every deployment serves these models: check `GET /v1/models`."
msgstr ""
"部署要注册的是右列的 id（作为模型 id 或别名），而不是 Claude Code 发送的名称；直接注册 `claude-sonnet-4-6`"
" 会得到 404。其他 id 按原样查找。`claude-sonnet-4-6[1m]` "
"这类长上下文标记会先被去掉，所以不要注册带方括号的形式。并非每个部署都提供这些模型，请先查询 `GET /v1/models`。"

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:49
msgid ""
"To choose the model behind each of Claude Code's families, add these to "
"the same `env` block. Claude Code resolves them itself and sends the "
"resulting id:"
msgstr ""
"要为 Claude Code 的每个模型系列指定实际使用的模型，在同一个 `env` 块中加入以下变量。Claude Code "
"会自己解析它们，再发送解析后的 id："

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:60
msgid "The Haiku model handles Claude Code's smaller background calls."
msgstr "Haiku 对应的模型用于 Claude Code 较小的后台调用。"

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:62
msgid "Usage and Verification"
msgstr "使用与验证"

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:69
msgid ""
"`/status` shows the active model and gateway; `/model` switches models. "
"Tool use, file editing and search work when the gateway model supports "
"tool calls."
msgstr "`/status` 显示当前模型和网关，`/model` 用于切换模型。只要网关上的模型支持工具调用，工具使用、文件编辑和搜索都能正常工作。"

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:72
msgid ""
"This configures inference for Claude Code on this machine only. "
"Anthropic's server tools (web search, web fetch, code execution, MCP "
"connectors and the other tools Anthropic runs and bills per use) are not "
"available through the gateway, which cannot bill them: on a model served "
"by Anthropic's API, a request for one gets `400 invalid_request_error`. "
"Tools that Claude Code runs itself are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"这些设置只影响本机 Claude Code 的推理。Anthropic 的服务端工具（网页搜索、网页抓取、代码执行、MCP 连接器，以及其他由 "
"Anthropic 运行并按次计费的工具）无法通过网关使用，因为网关无法为它们计费：对由 Anthropic API "
"提供的模型请求这类工具，会得到 `400 invalid_request_error`。Claude Code 自己运行的工具不受影响。"

