msgid ""
"The gateway has no route for the final model ID, or your key's role "
"cannot see it"
msgstr "网关没有为最终的模型 ID 配置路由，或者你的 key 所属角色看不到该模型"

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md
msgid ""
"Query `GET /v1/models` (it lists what your key can reach), then update "
"`model` or the matching `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_*_MODEL`"
msgstr ""
"查 `GET /v1/models`（它会列出你的 key 能访问的模型），再更新 `model` 或对应的 "
"`ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_*_MODEL`"

