#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:89
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "卸载"

#: ../developer/claude-code-setup.md:91
msgid ""
"Remove `model`, `ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL`, `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` and any "
"`ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_*_MODEL` keys from `~/.claude/settings.json`, keeping "
"your other settings. Claude Code then talks to Anthropic directly again."
msgstr ""
"从 `~/.claude/settings.json` 中删除 "
"`model`、`ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL`、`ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` 以及所有 "
"`ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_*_MODEL` 键，保留其他设置。之后 Claude Code 会重新直接连接 Anthropic。"

